  "ingredients": [
    "2 (6 ounce) beef top sirloin steaks",
    "2 cups orange juice",
    "1 cup apple cider vinegar",
    "0.5 cup Worcestershire sauce",
    "1.5 tablespoons steak seasoning (such as Fiesta Brand® Uncle Chris'), or to taste",
    "freshly ground black pepper to taste",
    "2 teaspoons olive oil",
    "sea salt to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/aWY6oK9fk9ZLMjoV158pDLFSCww=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/262181-cast-iron-pan-seared-steak-oven-finished-ddmfs-3172-4x3-step-01-9acf64aabbe747379c7b1eb1fcee63f2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/262181/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place steaks side by side in large casserole dish. Add orange juice, cider vinegar, and Worcestershire sauce. Marinate, uncovered, in the refrigerator for 45 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/msZJ_pGUNJQRw0psJoS4CNXVl24=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/262181-cast-iron-pan-seared-steak-oven-finished-ddmfs-3176-4x3-step-02-f14897ab79b042f0b19e70834124856c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/262181/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 425 degrees F (220 degrees C). Remove casserole dish from refrigerator. Cover steaks with plastic wrap and let allow to come to room temperature, at least 15 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/1qgWD0jSaL8wJsA9-tz_a99_QS0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/262181-cast-iron-pan-seared-steak-oven-finished-ddmfs-3180-4x3-step-03-eacc5dde334f479bbdace8a26f450169.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/262181/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place steaks on a clean work surface and generously rub with steak seasoning and black pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/7Ldex_vF23DiB4DNXbYyPg9CkYM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/262181-cast-iron-pan-seared-steak-oven-finished-ddmfs-3212-4x3-step-04-98ed0141250342efaab82ec7e4793159.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/262181/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat olive oil in a cast-iron skillet over high heat. Cook steaks in the hot skillet until lightly browned on the bottom, 2 ½ minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/CLHyH7b9RiSvdO_y3m1MsKHVnfA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/262181-cast-iron-pan-seared-steak-oven-finished-ddmfs-3215-4x3-step-05-6a64390adc264eb4a5694154a43bb1c8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/262181/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Flip and cook until browned on the other side and red in the center, about 2 minutes more. Transfer skillet with the steaks to the oven.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/9se8AKuuXsknrODmF1PRudN5Oso=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/262181-cast-iron-pan-seared-steak-oven-finished-ddmfs-3216-4x3-step06-5dc7b6a486ca4ee59a28124238b5d2d0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/262181/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until steaks are firm and reddish-pink to lightly pink in the center, 8 to 10 minutes. An instant-read thermometer inserted into the center should read from 130 degrees F (54 degrees C) to 140 degrees F (60 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/6LARuUGkQeFFIWn1mU6CaJhwcw0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/262181-cast-iron-pan-seared-steak-oven-finished-ddmfs-3218-4x3-step-07-3c88aae0b42e4fc9bcbc5220dcaae9bf.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/262181/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove steaks from oven; season with salt. Let rest for 5 minutes before serving.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/0EFivxkCvoYSmzLxrpHora2qxfk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/262181-cast-iron-pan-seared-steak-oven-finished-ddmfs-3226-4x3-step-08-6a49eb2ca8204923aef574cb68f10df9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/262181/step_08.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/qwisE2Y3LsOY5ZdD4RSo1NLYq3E=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/262181-cast-iron-pan-seared-steak-oven-finished-DDMFS-4x3-50c37d683f4a42c1bc9ff0fe3c24e417.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/262181/step_09.webp"
    }
  ],
